  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since it doesn't look like we're getting avatar remeasure anytime soon, could we get an option in the configuration section of the action menu that just lets us scale the avatar we're using? It could be a radial going from 25/50% to 150/200% the original size.\nThis has to be possible since fallback avatars scale depending on the size of the PC avatar (as far as I know). The avatar remeasure is a very anticipated feature and this would probably be enough to satisfy the need for it.\nIt would be super useful for game worlds that require a certain height or have a limit, like Laserdome. If I wanna play by the rules I have to resize my avatar in Unity every time or have two copies of it and it's kinda annoying.",
